From 91a1c0869fa56f5c2b84afb1c7442ea50060707f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Habiba <dev@example.com>
Date: Fri, 2 Oct 2026 18:07:49 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] feat: settlements, shared data cache, table filters/limit,
 garment theme
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

- settlement (تسوية): close the account up to a month, count only what's after it
- one shared data store with local cache: instant open, background refresh
- Apps Script: single 'all' request, spreadsheet/timezone opened once per request (was once per date cell), auto-created Settlements sheet
- Models/Payments: newest first, search + month filter, first 50 rows + show more
- dashboard: last 7 weeks in the chart, removed total fabric card
- garment theme: scissors/spool/mannequin icons, stitched borders, new app icon
